cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "AgentRisk: One risk score per AI agent"
abstract: >-
  AgentRisk scores an AI agent deployment on exposure, capability, autonomy
  and reversibility, ranks a fleet by risk, and names the single mitigation
  that lowers each score most.
authors:
